    the footer. Two or three actions at most, the main one wider and in brand color. %>
<div class="fixed inset-x-0 bottom-0 z-30 border-t border-line bg-surface/95 px-3 pt-2 pb-[max(0.5rem,env(safe-area-inset-bottom))] backdrop-blur md:hidden">
